OL,3,GNEWSANew devolved authority will not
OL,4,Ainclude Northants
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government has decided that
OL,7,FNorthamptonshire will not be included
OL,8,Fin its devolution plans for an area
OL,9,Fdubbed the South Midlands Strategic
OL,10,FAuthority.
OL,12,FInstead, Jim McMahon, the minister for
OL,13,Flocal government, devolution and
OL,14,Fgrowth, confirmed Central Bedfordshire,
OL,15,FBedford, Luton and Milton Keynes, could
OL,16,Fpush forward with a joint authority.
OL,18,FMark Arnull, leader of West
OL,19,FNorthamptonshire Council, which is run
OL,20,Fby Reform UK, expressed his
OL,21,Fdisappointment.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,367,360,200,160,0,100
