OL,3,GNEWSANew devolved authority will not
OL,4,Ainclude Northants
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said: "We will continue to engage
OL,7,Fconstructively with government and
OL,8,Fneighbouring authorities to secure the
OL,9,Fbest possible devolution settlement for
OL,10,Four residents, businesses and
OL,11,Fcommunities."
